\subsection{Results of Forgery Attacks}
\label{sec:expforgery}

%In this section, we evaluate the dataset auditing attacks against forgery attacks. 
For forgery attacks, we assume that the adversary wants to make their own dataset (\ie, the attack auxiliary dataset) to be falsely identified as the `trained dataset' of other independent models. We use the model trained on the unmarked release dataset as the independent model. The results of white-box forgery attacks are in Table~\ref{tab:forgery}, and the experiments in the black-box scenario can be found in Appendix~\ref{apd:blackbox}.

