\subsection{Evaluating Dataset Auditing in the Fine-tuning Scenario}
\label{apd:finetuning}

%Beyond training models from scratch, fine-tuning pre-trained models on smaller, task-specific datasets represents a common and efficient paradigm in modern DL. Particularly with the rise of large foundation models~\cite{guo2025deepseek}, fine-tuning has become a critical technique. This section assesses the robustness of existing methods in the fine-tuning scenario.
