|\mathrm{Sz}(q)|^2  \le  c^2  \ \mathbf{B}(\mathrm{Sz}(q))^3 \le   {\mathbf{B}(\mathrm{Sz}(q))}^2  \ {( \mathbf{B}(\mathrm{Sz}(q))+1)}^2   \ \Longrightarrow \ \mathrm{Sz}(q) \in \mathcal{H}.
