Although the estimated parameters from the three packages are similar, they are not identical. Hence, we computed the relative error between our \texttt{FedIRT} results and those obtained using \texttt{mirt}, as well as the relative errors between \texttt{ltm} and \texttt{mirt} as a benchmark. The relative error in our case was defined using the formulas below:
