    $\ket{10} \otimes ( \tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \ket{00} + \tfrac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \ket{01} )$
    with probability $\tfrac{|\alpha|^2}{\sqrt{|\alpha|^2+|\beta|^2}}$.
\end{example}

