 \eqref{5.ENS} and  fix a
 sufficiently large $L$ for a set  of vertices~ $\Xi$
 with $\#\Xi=N$ in such a way that
 Theorem \ref{Th4.main} holds.
% Next, since $\dim_F\mathcal A<\infty$,
% assuming that  $\dim_F\mathcal A\ge1$
